Z||000007||PeaceDawg||05-28-2001||12:04 PM||||The spark plugs are "Champions".  The car is actually out in the country at my brothers place so I am relaying this info over the phone to him. He did scan the sensors but at a garage scan would be more thorough.  He said when he changed the plugs it fired right up but when he shut it off if flooded again.<BR>Gonna try replacing the ecm coolant temp sensor. trial and error...When he did have it running the fan wouldn't come on and it started to overheat so it looks like this might be the right way to go.  Thanks..btw we originally thought it was the injectors and I have a complete fuel injection system coming to me from ebay. At least I will have some spare parts.<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||6
