Z||000009||87GTZ34||05-28-2001||02:14 PM||||Check the leakdown rate of the fuel pressure.  If you need the procedure, then post back and at least 50 people will give you help...   You may have leaky cylinder injectors or a leaky cold start injector.  Are all plug equally wet? GL||||reg||3
