Z||000020||TooManyFieros||10-08-2001||02:27 PM||||I'll bet it's the pickup coil in the dist. Maybe the ignition module or coil. I had a similiar problem a while back an it was due to weak spark. Finally found the dist was the problem. A rebuilt dist is chaper then replacing the pickup coil and module. Let us know how you make out. maybe you can borrow a dist from a friend.||||reg||1
